---
{
  "title": "Home",
  "publishedAt": "###HOME_PUBLISHED_AT###",
  "modifiedAt": "###MODIFIED_AT###",
  "pageTypeId": "###ROOT_PAGE_TYPE_ID###",
  "pageId": "###HOME_PAGE_ID###"
}
---
{{!--
    The home page, from the Leed plugin's site-onboarding starter. A pass-through page: its own markup,
    wrapped in the site template (site-patterns rule 8).

    pageTypeId and pageId are the values the provisioned home page already had, kept so every
    pageid: link to home stays valid. Links go by pageid: (rule 5) and buttons use the .btn system.
--}}
{{#>site-template}}

<section class="site-hero">
  <h1>{{ siteTitle }}</h1>
  <p class="site-hero__lead">###TAGLINE###</p>
  <div class="site-hero__actions">
    <a href="pageid:###PRIMARY_PAGE_ID###" class="btn btn-primary"
       data-reason="utm_campaign=leed&utm_source=internal&utm_medium=hero&utm_term=primary">###PRIMARY_LABEL###</a>
  </div>
</section>

{{/site-template}}
